{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe light in the Louvre galleries is fading as the exhibition of living painters prepares to take over. I walked the halls again today, thinking of our conversation with Cousin. The art here is vibrant, yet it lacks the profound ethical depth I seek in the historical development of spirit. Raumer and Panofka joined me; their company was pleasant, though I find myself missing the familiar quiet of our study in Berlin.\n\nIn the evening, I attended the Théâtre-Français. *Alzire* and *Emilia* were performed with Mlle Mars and Mlle Leverd. The acting was competent, but the dialogue felt thin compared to the weight of true philosophical inquiry. I am tired, yet my mind remains restless. I hope this letter reaches you safely. Tell the boys I am well and think of them often. The journey continues, but my heart remains with you.\n\nYours ever,\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795080686,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":199,"prompt_tokens":952,"total_tokens":1151,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-QTAxKWlg1uCOGAogFSwU49UeYF2TIRiM","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":952,"prompt_ms":929.375,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.976234243697479,"prompt_per_second":1024.3443174176193,"predicted_n":199,"predicted_ms":4754.418,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.01221212121212,"predicted_per_second":41.64547585004095}}